# Petrolimex AI Backend

Multi-camera AI detection system for gas stations with real-time processing and event management.

## Quick Start

### Development (Local)

```text
# 1. Install dependencies
uv sync

# 2. Setup environment
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env and set your database credentials

# 3. Run the API server (MAIN APPLICATION)
python -m src.server  # API: http://localhost:8668/docs
```

Linux / Bash:

```bash
cd /path/to/petrolimex-ai-backend
source .venv/bin/activate
DB_HOST=localhost DB_USER=dang321 DB_NAME=petrobe_db DB_PASSWORD=Dang2510 DB_PORT=5433 python -m src.server
```
